mindmap
  root((Bulk RCD/PMIC Endpoint))
    WHY
      2023 of 9402 DIMM rows still blank
      Loop ran 02:28 to 02:31 then stopped at 7379
      Only 117 unique part numbers in the whole table
      Same PN filled on 63 rows, blank on 19
      Decoder is fine - all 8 missing PNs decode OK
    SERVER - server.py
      Route POST /api/items/bulk-rcd-pmic
        Guard _require_admin
        Actor from _sessions for modified_by
        Body model BulkRcdPmicIn
          updates dict of part_number to rcd and pmic
        Returns updated count and per-PN breakdown
      Helper _bulk_update_rcd_pmic
        One _DB_LOCK, one BEGIN IMMEDIATE
        executemany over ~32 PN rows
        UPDATE items SET rcd, pmic, updatedAt, modified_by
        WHERE part_number = ? AND lower category LIKE dimm
        Fill-only clause so manual edits survive
          AND rcd = '' AND pmic = ''
        Commit once, report conn.total_changes
    CLIENT - static/index.html
      Delete the sequential PUT loop
        _applyRcdPmicToItems lines 1628 to 1644
        Drop stale full-table-rewrite comment
      Send lookupResults as one POST
      Re-fetch /api/items on success
      renderTable once at the end
      Surface errors instead of empty catch
      Keep localStorage PN cache untouched
    GUARDS
      Skip entries where rcd and pmic are both blank
      WARNING and ERROR already stripped by _clean
      Reject payload over a sane PN count
      Idempotent - safe to re-run any time
      No schema change needed
    PAYOFF
      1 request instead of 2023 round trips
      1 transaction instead of 2023 commits
      Sub-second instead of ~10 minutes
      Closing the tab can no longer leave half the table blank
      Progress no longer depends on the browser staying open
